danu (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add danu-soak, which writes the limit file danu-build already honours so a
    night's run rebuilds two zones for real rather than finding nothing
    changed. Zones are taken in sorted order from a cursor, and it runs on a
    budget of nights so a soak stops on its own.
  * The soak timer is installed but not enabled: forcing rebuilds is a test,
    not what a fresh install should start doing.

 -- Lee Kindness <wangi@opengeofiction.net>  Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:30:00 +0000

danu (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add python3-pyosmium and zip to Depends; both were used and neither
    declared.
  * Move the pure geometry and grading to danu.core.profile, which imports no
    GDAL, so the tests run without it.

 -- Lee Kindness <wangi@opengeofiction.net>  Fri, 18 Sep 2026 10:30:00 +0000

danu (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Collect the run log from the danu-build unit rather than the pre-move
    dem-build one; the published log had been empty since the cutover.
  * Publish the run log and progress as danu-build-log*.txt and
    danu-build-progress.txt.
  * Rename the backup lock file to danu-backup.lock.

 -- Lee Kindness <wangi@opengeofiction.net>  Fri, 18 Sep 2026 08:50:00 +0000

danu (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package. The elevation pipeline moved out of ogf-server-scripts,
    restructured into the danu packages, with the systemd units renamed from
    dem-build and backup-elevation to danu-build and danu-backup.

